<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The wife, the Bride of Jesus must seek to, ready, be,</l><l>To be mature in life and be builded corp’rately;</l><l>This bride is full adorned with the pearls and precious stones,</l><l>And plaits of gold her nature, the triune God, her own.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>This precious bride is clothed with fine linen, bright and clean,</l><l>The righteousnesses stitched by the Lamb within our being;</l><l>A Christ lived out each day is an overcoming life,</l><l>‘Tis right and pure and holy; to her to live is Christ.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The overcoming life is not ours by natural strength,</l><l>But by Christ’s resurrection, Christ’s depth, and height, and length;</l><l>For by the Lamb’s redemption we taste this feast of grace</l><l>And through organic salvation grow through each test we face.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>The overcoming strength is not in how hard we try,</l><l>But living every moment, the extra oil to buy;</l><l>Christ’s overcoming life pours out from His pierced side,</l><l>The Spirit and the Bride say, “Come now and be My bride!”</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
